<title>USA: CytRx says Zynaxis holders approve merger.</title>
<headline>CytRx says Zynaxis holders approve merger.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA, Ga. 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>CytRx Corp said on Thursday that shareholders of Zynaxis Inc approved the merger between Zynaxis and CytRx's Vaxcel Inc unit.</p>
<p>The merged company will operate under the name Vaxcel Inc VAXL.O, CytRx said in a statement. CytRx will hold about 9.6 million of Vaxcel's 11 million shares outstanding with the rest held by public shareholders, CytRx said.</p>
<p>CytRx is a biopharmaceutical company that develops treatments for vascular and infectious diseases, burns and cancer.</p>
</text>
